    "description": "Welcome to this beautifully renovated, single-story home in highly desirable Tanglewood Forest. Soaring ceilings, abundant natural light, and an open, functional floor plan create a warm and inviting space for everyday living and entertaining. The spacious family room features wood floors, a vaulted ceiling, and a cozy wood-burning fireplace, flowing seamlessly into the kitchen and breakfast area. The kitchen offers plenty of workspace, an oversized black marble island, designer lighting, ample cabinetry, stainless steel appliances, a gas range, open shelving, and a sunny dining nook overlooking the backyard. The private primary suite includes two closets, an ensuite bath with a walk-in shower and dual vanities, plus direct access to the covered patio. Two additional bedrooms and an updated bathroom provide flexibility for guests, family, or a home office. Outside, enjoy the fenced backyard, mature trees, expansive deck, and custom pergola with a retractable canopy, perfect for relaxing or entertaining. Conveniently located near shopping, dining, parks, and major commuter routes, this home offers comfort, style, and the best of South Austin living.",
